WEBVTT

00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:01.530
and that task force was spread across the Mideast

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.118
to fight al Qaeda.

00:01:03.118 --> 00:01:06.115
Our main effort was inside Iraq,

00:01:06.115 --> 00:01:08.082
and our specified mission

00:01:08.082 --> 00:01:09.936
was to defeat al Qaeda in Iraq.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:13.040
For almost five years I stayed there,

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.850
and we focused on fighting a war

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:19.896
that was unconventional and it was difficult

00:01:19.896 --> 00:01:21.736
and it was bloody

00:01:21.736 --> 00:01:24.830
and it often claimed its highest price

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:27.904
among innocent people.

00:01:27.904 --> 00:01:30.409
We did everything we could